今年も無制限で直筆をね、書かせていただく予定なので、ぜひこの機会にゲットしてみてください！
This year too, I'm planning to write all the signatures without limit, so definitely take this chance to get them!

418
00:55:57,680 --> 00:56:11,360
ということで、新曲MV公開中！楽曲リリース中！誕生日グッズ発売中！12月『Haba naisudei』書籍刊行決定…！
So, the new song MV is out, the song is released, birthday goods are on sale, and the 'Haba naisudei' book release in December is decided...!

419
00:56:12,060 --> 00:56:14,140
よろしくお願いいたします！
Thank you for your support!

420
